  "title": "Cadiz and Bureau of Reclamation Execute Funding Agreement for Evaluation of Mojave Groundwater Bank",
  "summary": "Cadiz, CALIFORNIA (05.26.26) — Cadiz, Inc. (NASDAQ: CDZI / CDZIP, the “Company”) today announced that it has entered into a funding agreement (“Agreement”) with the U.S. Bureau of Reclamation to support technical and regulatory review activities associated with the Mojave Groundwater Bank project under the Memorandum of Understanding executed in September 2025 between Reclamation, Fenner Valley […]",
